{"words": [{"text": "وَدَّت", "translation": "Wished"}, {"text": "طَّآئِفَةٌۭ", "translation": "a group"}, {"text": "مِّنْ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "أَهْلِ", "translation": "(the) People"}, {"text": "ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ", "translation": "(of) the Book"}, {"text": "لَوْ", "translation": "if"}, {"text": "يُضِلُّونَكُمْ", "translation": "they could lead you astray"}, {"text": "وَمَا", "translation": "and not"}, {"text": "يُضِلُّونَ", "translation": "they lead astray"}, {"text": "إِلَّآ", "translation": "except"}, {"text": "أَنفُسَهُمْ", "translation": "themselves"}, {"text": "وَمَا", "translation": "and not"}, {"text": "يَشْعُرُونَ", "translation": "they perceive"}], "sahih": "A faction of the People of the Scripture wish they could mislead you. But they do not mislead except themselves, and they perceive [it] not."}